{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_genel",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "Peace be upon you, master guard. Have you any command or inquiry?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_hal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -270.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "How fare you, friend? Is your spirits in good heart?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_is",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "How fares your daily toil? Are you content with your duty?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_havadis",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 90.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "What is spoken in the village? Has any news reached your ear?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_rica",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 270.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Have you any important matter you wish to speak to me about?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:cond_moral",
      "type": "CONDITION",
      "position": "(1050.0, -270.0)",
      "description": "Moral Kontrolü",
      "combiner": "ALL",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact_ref": "res://src/diyalog/facts/koylu_moral_fact.gd",
          "operator": 0,
          "value": "iyi"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_moral_iyi",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, -360.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "Praise be to God, master, we have a roof over our heads and soup in our bowls. May smoke ever rise from your chimney."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_moral_kotu",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "How could it be, gatekeeper... Our backs ache, and our hearts are weary. Yet we thank Heaven that we still stand on our feet."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_moral_iyi",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1750.0, -360.0)",
      "description": "Moral Artışı",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_is",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -90.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "By day we pour sweat in the furrowed fields and at the looms. The labor of the village never ceases; if the peasant toils, the settlement is fed."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:cond_havadis",
      "type": "CONDITION",
      "position": "(1050.0, 90.0)",
      "description": "Havadis Kontrolü",
      "combiner": "ALL",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "fact_ref": "res://src/diyalog/facts/koy_havadis_fact.gd",
          "operator": 0,
          "value": "harami"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_havadis_tehdit",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "They saw torches flickering in the mountain gorge at midnight, master... They whisper a band of brigands is prowling the trails; our eyes and ears are vigilant."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_havadis_sakin",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1400.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "Matters are tranquil for the moment, gatekeeper. Only the elders say the winter frost will strike earlier than usual this year."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_rica",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 270.0)",
      "character": "Villager",
      "text": "May your health and authority endure, master guard. Our concern is daily bread; may your justice never be wanting from our midst."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_rica",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 270.0)",
      "description": "Adalet/Moral Etkisi",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:end",
      "type": "END",
      "position": "(2100.0, 0.0)"
    }
  ],
